Subject: [PATCH 11/12] Document and version the 0.3.0 performance release

Bump the crate and Python package to 0.3.0. Add docs/user-manual.md, a
complete reference whose Python blocks validation/release_checks.py now
executes after the tutorial's, and rewrite docs/architecture.md for the
0.3.0 code with measured performance data. Update the README, tutorial
and model card for score_matrix and the prepared SIR projection.

Add application and optimization examples under examples/python/ with
their recorded outputs, a Rust score_matrix example
(examples/matrix_scan.rs) and the time-breakdown harness
(examples/breakdown.rs). Add the cumulative native comparison, the time
breakdown and the installed Python optimization runs under
evidence/performance-0.3.0/. Keep release artifacts, patches and round
evidence out of the source distribution.

